WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.469 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm at a really nice time
in my life right now.

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:03.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, that's wonderful.
-Yes.

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:05.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Why does that get a laugh?

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:07.340 align:start size:94% position:6%
If I say things
are going well --

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.576 line:92%
I just had my second grandchild.

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:10.176 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Congratulations!

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:13.246 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-No, don't -- Wait.

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:13.813 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Don't applaud.

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:16.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
My daughter's 13,
so we're a little upset.

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:18.618 size:88% position:44% line:92%
But she's very friendly,

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:20.553 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we got to teach her,
you know, just wave.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:22.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And it's the second one.
It's the second one.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:25.091 line:92%
-Well, she's 13, so, you know...

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:27.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you --
I want to ask this question

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause I have a 16-month-old.
-Okay.

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:32.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I'm now at the age
where he can be entertained,

00:00:32.499 --> 00:00:33.400 line:92%
so you try to entertain him.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you try to entertain
your grandkids?

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:36.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you try to make them laugh?
-Yeah, I do.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:41.107
And you know what happens?
That's how I spend my days now.

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:42.208 line:92%
And that's why I feel good.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:45.078
And you find --
You know, I spent so many years

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:47.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
writing material,
and I still tour as a comic.

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:50.283
But most of my time entertaining
is to entertain

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:53.420 align:start size:94% position:6%
a 1-year-old
or, you know, a 2-year-old,

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.922 line:92%
and your sense of humor changes.

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:57.123 line:92%
And you find that, like, even --

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:59.192 align:start size:94% position:6%
I got here yesterday,
and I went to a restaurant,

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:00.960 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the whole
"got your nose" routine

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:05.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
doesn't work on the maîître d'
as well as it does...

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:06.633
You know, I thought maybe
I'd get a better table.

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:09.836 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know what I did? In the
street -- You got to try this.

00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:11.204 line:92%
Go up to a stranger from behind

00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:13.640 size:75% position:38%
and cover their eyes
and go, "Guess who!"

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:18.478
And they'll keep guessing.
My record now is 35 minutes.

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:19.779 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"No."

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:22.148 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Is it Paul?" "No."

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:24.117 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"David?" "No."

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:26.653 size:81% position:41%
New York is real weird
for me in the street.

00:01:26.653 --> 00:01:28.655 align:start size:94% position:6%
My daughter before --
She's not 13.

00:01:28.655 --> 00:01:30.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was a --
She's watching, so she --

00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:33.526
You got to know that I joke,
and that's how you were able

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:35.462 align:start size:94% position:6%
to grow up in the house
you grew up in.

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:38.164
But I --
No, I'm just explaining to her.

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:39.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
She'll go,
"Why did you say I was 13?"

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:41.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
But when she was here,
she was pregnant,

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:44.637 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I don't know
if your wife experienced this.

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:46.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you live right in the city?
-Yes, we do.

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:49.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did you find that strangers
would touch her stomach?

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:50.543 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-Would actually touch --

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:53.813
They go up to a pregnant woman,
and they would go, "Oh, when?"

00:01:53.813 --> 00:01:57.517 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I would never
put my hand on a woman --

00:01:57.517 --> 00:02:00.186 align:start size:94% position:6%
First of all,
what if she's not pregnant?

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:01.020 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Like, when --

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like,
"When...did you have lunch?

00:02:03.256 --> 00:02:07.227 size:84% position:42%
Because it looks like
you really enjoyed it."

00:02:07.227 --> 00:02:08.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So helpful.
-It is.

00:02:08.061 --> 00:02:10.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I feel like nobody ever tells
you these helpful tips.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.198 size:78% position:39%
-That's why I'm here.
I'm here to tell you.

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:14.300 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know what's funny?
I'm looking at --
What's your name?

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're a beautiful young lady.
Beyoncé's drummer.

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:17.270 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Joy.
-Venzella over there.

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:20.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. You were looking at me
like you were disgusted

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:23.343 align:start size:94% position:6%
when I said --
Did I disgust you?

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:24.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm just --
-A little bit.

00:02:24.444 --> 00:02:26.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just a little bit?
-Just a little bit.

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:27.647 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sorry.
-I'm sorry.

00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:28.481 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-We try to not have

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:31.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
disgusted drummers
in the eye line of the guests.

